# The build context of Dockerfile is the repository root (the indexer links programs/ and crates/
# by path). BuildKit reads this file for this Dockerfile only (it overrides a root .dockerignore).
# Never send build output, dependencies, local data or keys into the image's build stage.
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
.git
fuzz-out
docs
.anchor
.surfpool
test-ledger
# Program-id keypairs (never committed; docs/DEVELOPMENT.md "Program id and keypair").
keys
**/keys
**/*-keypair.json
# Deployment secrets and environment files.
services/indexer/deploy/secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
